===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
[[File:Drosophila.jpg|thumb|A [[drosophila]]]]

# {{senseid|en|Tephritidae}} Any insect of the [[Tephritidae]] [[family]], whose larvae damage [[plant]] [[tissue]].
# {{senseid|en|Drosophilidae}} Any insect of the [[Drosophilidae]] family, whose [[larvae]] feed on [[ripening]] [[fruit]], especially the [[species]] ''[[Drosophila melanogaster]]'' that is used in [[genetic]] [[research]].
#: {{hypo|en|drosophila}}
# {{lb|en|slang}} A [[woman]] who enjoys the company of [[homosexual]] men; a "[[fag hag]]".

